  "Priority": "priyoridad",
  "A same column name was found in the English name column and was handled automatically. Please check the column names.": "Ang isang dobleng pangalan ng Ingles ay napansin, kaya awtomatikong idinagdag ang serial number. Suriin ang mga pangalan ng haligi.",
